rativo. -</p><p style="text-align:justify"><strong>Firma: __________________________________________________</strong></p><p style="text-align:justify"><strong>Aclaración: ______________________________________________</strong></p><p style="text-align:justify"><strong>D.N.I. </strong><strong>Nº</strong><strong>: _______________________________________________</strong></p><p style="text-align:justify"><strong>Teléfono de contacto: _____________________________________</strong></p><p><strong>Constituyo domicilio electrónico: ___________________________</strong></p>' WHERE codigo = 'COMPROMISO_CONTRAVENCION_PV';
